---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AuthorCard from "@/components/AuthorCard.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me">
    <article class="prose max-w-none">
        <h2>Hello, I'm Yusheng Chen!</h2>

        <p>I'm a designer and a builder in Ann Arbor, MI, USA now</p>

        <h2>Professional Journey</h2>
        <p>
            With a background in linguistics and design with a passion for
            technology, I've had the opportunity to hone my skills in system
            architecture and cloud computing while working in Taipei's tech
            scene. Now served as student in Ann Arbor
        </p>

        <h3>Technical Expertise</h3>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Languages</strong>: Python, JavaScript, C++ and Rust
            </li>
            <li><strong>Frontend</strong>: React, Vue.js, Next.js</li>
            <li><strong>Backend</strong>: Node.js, Django, fastapi</li>
            <li><strong>Cloud</strong>: AWS, GCP</li>
            <li><strong>DevOps</strong>: Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD</li>
            <li><strong>Data</strong>: PostgreSQL, supabase, Redis</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Current Focus</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Working on improving development workflows and automation</li>
            <li>Learning new technologies and best practices</li>
            <li>Documenting my journey through this blog</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why This Blog?</h2>

        <p>This blog serves as my digital workspace where I:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Share technical insights and solutions</li>
            <li>Explore the intersection of technology and design</li>
            <li>My ideas and opinions from my work</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Connect With Me</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/uilfl">uilfl</a></li>
            <li>Based in: Ann Arbor</li>
            <li>Open for collaboration on interesting projects</li>
        </ul>

        <hr />

        <p>
            <em
                >Interested in collaboration or have questions about my
                workflow? Feel free to reach out through GitHub or any of the
                channels above!</em
            >
        </p>
    </article>

    <AuthorCard class="mt-10" />
</BaseLayout>
